  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Grab Samples and Video Images of Bottom Habitat during Trawling",
  "description": "Compare physical and biological variable between trawled areas before and after experimental trawling by using closed trawling vs. un-closed trawled Using acoustic - echo - images. There will be 6 Stations, each will collect (1) cores-grabs (2) video transect (3) ASP and (4) VanVeen grab. An NPMR project\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Support NPMR project \"Purpose is to Determine the impact of commercial trawling on the Bering Sea\"",
